5. FLOOD - INDIA FLOOD EVENTS DATASET
==============================================

Dataset Name: India Flood Inventory
Filename: India_Flood_Inventory_v3.csv

Source: HydroSense Lab
Organization: Indian Institute of Technology Delhi
Repository: Zenodo
Format: CSV
Coverage: India
Time Period: 1967-2023

Citation:
Saharia, M. (2025).
India Flood Inventory-Impacts (IFI-Impacts),
1967-2023, Version 4 [Dataset]. Zenodo.

DOI:
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16994648

Dataset Source:
https://zenodo.org/records/16994648

Direct Download:
https://zenodo.org/records/16994648/files/India_Flood_Inventory_v3.csv?download=1

Related Research:
https://doi.org/10.1007/s11069-021-04698-6

Purpose:
Used to analyze historical flood events,
identify flood-affected regions, compare
flood occurrences, and visualize flood
patterns across Indian states and districts.


