National Water Informatics Centre,
Government of India.

Dataset Source:
https://nwdp.nwic.gov.in/dataset/rainfall-daily-imd

Direct Download:
https://nwdp.nwic.gov.in/dataset/9380580f-9bf0-4708-9773-0cea3cbc595a/resource/acd3023c-df96-4af8-8815-a7393cb80839/download/rainfall_statewise_daily_imd.csv

Purpose:
